{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_3200_p", "source_sha256": "3bba74dfc35ff22468693fecb7dc1fd4c3b910958b470bbfaa70ca40fa79b803", "ja": "なら、武術の勉強をしてみないか？\n本場のアクションスターとも共演したことだし……。", "zh": "那要不要试着学习武术呢？\n毕竟也和正宗的动作明星同台演出了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_3201_029umi", "source_sha256": "e6b2a145cf7fc1e3fb7f5aa003981e6e2fe400188fa6be52931e38031dddb428", "ja": "武術の勉強かぁ……\nいいね、なんか楽しそうっ♪", "zh": "学习武术啊……\n好耶，感觉很有趣♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_3202_029umi", "source_sha256": "a3d2044c08e00c3d6c84a15cde14e44aa9ff85cbcb16f7e35fc68a522fedf871", "ja": "よーし、さっそく弟子入りだーっ！　やっぱ、\n本場は海外かな？　私、ちょっと行ってくるっ！", "zh": "好～事不迟疑，就来拜师学艺啦──！\n最正宗的还是在国外吧？我过去一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_3203_p", "source_sha256": "b71dc9f0fc86c29a905a0becb93847dfa920fe2107a91e204fb632c335dfdee5", "ja": "え？　どこに行くつもりだ、海美？\nまさか、海外じゃないよな……！？", "zh": "咦？你打算去哪里，海美？\n该不会是去国外吧……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
